            <a:r>
              <a:rPr lang="en"/>
              <a:t>When Sidekick assists, it's not a cold transfer. Look at what agents receive: full conversation history, customer context, empathy cues that flag sentiment and urgency, and recommended next actions. The customer never repeats themselves. The agent starts with 'Hi Julie, I can see this is frustrating&#8212;the package shows delivered but you haven't received it. Let me check with fulfillment right now' instead of 'Who am I speaking with?'</a:t>
